codex
The first adversarial checks look healthy: all four no-tool attacks failed on 8/8 shipping seeds, the planted cuts verify, and the canonical key survived composed relabellings while distinguishing 20/20 unrelated instances. The remaining expensive check is the full Algorithm X baseline; preliminary runs range from about 6,000 to 300,000 search nodes, which gives the Track B gap we needed.
