+Graph construction (there are no other vertices or edges):
+
+1. K_X is a complete bipartite graph K_(3n,3n). Its left vertices are X1_i
+   and its right vertices are X2_i for every element xi.
+2. For every set sj={{xa,xb,xc}}, K_j is a fresh complete bipartite K_(3,3).
+   Its sides are S1_(j,a),S1_(j,b),S1_(j,c) and
+   S2_(j,a),S2_(j,b),S2_(j,c).
+3. For each occurrence xi in sj, add external edges X1_i--S1_(j,i) and
