+
+This defines a graph with {inst['graph_vertices']} vertices and
+{inst['graph_edges']} edges; it has radius at most 3 and diameter at most 4.
+Every K_X and K_j must be monochromatic in a valid colouring. Colour K_X and
+every unselected K_j red, and each selected K_j blue. To attain the maximum
+value 6n={inst['optimum_cut_size']}, select exactly n={inst['n']} set gadgets so
+that every element xi belongs to exactly one selected set. The resulting 6n
+external red-blue edges are a matching. They are optimal because every
+red-blue edge is external and K_X has only 6n vertices.
+
+The following exact integer weights annotate the elements; they add no graph
